  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Intersection point of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0089_5ffaa8083b9d.png\" style=\"width: 297px; height: 229px;\" /></p><p>Area of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>So required area<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math>area between the curve&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>ar</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#9651;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>32</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>8<